---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Use | WCE CGPA to Percentage Converter"
  description="Terms of Use for WCE CGPA to Percentage Converter."
>
  <div class="space-y-6 max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-10 font-sans">
    
    <!-- Page Header -->
    <div class="pb-4 border-b border-binance-border space-y-1.5">
      <div class="text-xs text-binance-yellow font-mono font-medium uppercase tracking-wider">
        Legal Terms & Unofficial Service Notice
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white">
        Terms of Use & Disclaimer
      </h1>
      <p class="text-binance-muted text-xs sm:text-sm max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">
        Please read these terms before using the WCE CGPA to Percentage Converter.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Terms Box -->
    <div class="bg-binance-card rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 border border-binance-border space-y-6 text-binance-text text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed binance-glow-card">
      
      <!-- Term 1: Provided As Is -->
      <section class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-white flex items-center gap-2">
          <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-binance-down shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path d="m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3Z"></path>
            <line x1="12" y1="9" x2="12" y2="13"></line>
            <line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12.01" y2="17"></line>
          </svg>
          <span>1. "As Is" Informational Purpose</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="text-binance-muted leading-relaxed">
          <strong>WCE CGPA to Percentage Converter</strong> is provided strictly on an <strong>"as is" and "as available" basis</strong> for convenience and informational reference purposes only. While every care has been taken to implement the exact published formulas from WCE's <i>Academic and Examination Rules and Regulations 2023-24</i>, no warranty or guarantee of absolute accuracy, completeness, or suitability for any specific official purpose is implied.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Term 2: Verification Requirement -->
      <section class="space-y-2 pt-4 border-t border-binance-border">
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-white flex items-center gap-2">
          <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-binance-up shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"></path>
            <path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path>
          </svg>
          <span>2. Official Verification Requirement</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="text-binance-muted leading-relaxed">
          This tool does not issue official transcripts or grade sheets. For any formal academic, job application, higher education admission, passport, visa, scholarship, or legal purpose, you must verify your results against your official grade card or confirm them directly with the <strong>WCE Examination Section</strong>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Term 3: Limitation of Liability -->
      <section class="space-y-2 pt-4 border-t border-binance-border">
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-white flex items-center gap-2">
          <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-binance-yellow shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"></path>
            <line x1="12" y1="8" x2="12" y2="12"></line>
            <line x1="12" y1="16" x2="12.01" y2="16"></line>
          </svg>
          <span>3. Limitation of Liability</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="text-binance-muted leading-relaxed">
          Under no circumstances shall the developer or site owner be held liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, consequential, or special damages or losses resulting from the use of, or inability to use, this application or any reliance placed upon calculations generated by it.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Term 4: Unofficial Status -->
      <section class="space-y-2 pt-4 border-t border-binance-border">
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-white">
          4. Unofficial Status Notice
        </h2>
        <p class="text-binance-muted leading-relaxed">
          This website is an independent student utility and is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or representative of Walchand College of Engineering, Sangli. All institution names are referenced solely for descriptive academic purposes.
        </p>
      </section>

    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
